\pard\b\fs20 The Golden Wipf - Multiclonks\b0\par
\fs16\par
The Golden Wipf Multiclonks is a modified version of the scenario "The Golden Wipf" by KKenny. In both versions the goal is to rescue the wipf and bring it to the GWE tower. Here you can also choose the assassin and the magus besides the paladin, and fight the AI enemies together. These worlds can be played alone or with several players.\par
\par
Have fun!\par
